{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"no\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"During repetitive stepping, when subjects were not freezing, STN beta power was lower and beta sample entropy was higher in Freezers compared to Non-Freezers. There was a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers, when stepping.\",\n    \"These results also suggest that deep brain stimulation parameters that result in complete attenuation of STN beta power may worsen rather than improve FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"During locomotion without FOG, Freezers showed lower beta (13–30 Hz) power (P = 0.036) and greater beta Sample Entropy (P = 0.032), than Non-Freezers, as well as greater gait asymmetry and arrhythmicity (P < 0.05 for both).\",\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"There were no differences in beta power or beta SampEn in the resting state or during FW (without FOG) between the Freezer and Non-Freezer groups.\",\n    \"Freezers demonstrated decreases in beta power during stepping without freezing compared to Non-Freezers and no difference at rest.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法与论文结果的方向相反。H2的核心命题是步态期间beta去同步化不足，即beta功率下降不充分；但论文在无冻结的原地踏步（SIP）任务中发现，Freezers的相对beta功率显著低于Non-Freezers，而且相对于静息状态的beta功率衰减更大。这意味着观察到的是更强而非更弱的beta功率衰减，不能作为H2的正向支持证据。论文还指出，完全消除STN beta功率可能反而加重FOG，进一步限制了简单的beta功率越低、步态越好的解释。指控者的核心方向判断有全文依据，因此报告将该研究列为H2支持证据确实存在误读。不过判为partly而非yes，是因为指控者对结果的概括需要一个重要限定：组间相对beta功率差异明确出现在无冻结的SIP任务中，而Forward Walking（FW）无冻结期间，Freezers与Non-Freezers之间没有beta功率差异。此外，论文测量的是任务期间的频段功率，并未直接证明步态周期各相位上的相位锁定ERD不足。因此，更严谨的结论是：该研究的SIP结果对H2的简单解释构成反向证据或限制，但不能据此断言所有步态任务中均存在更强的beta去同步化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "80afb4f1-fc02-4528-92eb-ed2c5a47f3f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T200605144612Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:07:29.433464+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "842f729df4e4f37f6d9cfe38af502b32ab7790d11795ce5f9e8ffc5815eed112", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T200605144612Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"